    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## edit after import\n\n**CAS — Persist Task State** — after UI import, complete bindings before activate:\n\n- Bind Data Table on **Insert durable task row**\n- Bind Data Table on **Update durable task row**\n\nDo not rely on env()/Globals for corporate UI import.",
